# TRON_MNEMONIC is no longer read from a local .env file.
#
# It is now provided at runtime via Firebase Secret Manager:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set TRON_MNEMONIC
#
# functions/index.js reads it from process.env.TRON_MNEMONIC, which
# Firebase automatically injects when the secret is bound to the
# function (see the "secrets" config in functions/index.js / firebase.json
# if you add it explicitly). Never put the real mnemonic in this file
# or commit any .env file containing it.
